    first_principle_target: "Conservation of Momentum",
    solution_outline: "Two-stage: energy gives post-impact speed $V=\\sqrt{2gh}=\\sqrt{2(9.8)(0.08)}\\approx1.25\\,\\text{m/s}$; momentum gives bullet speed $v=(M+m)V/m=(2.02)(1.25)/0.02\\approx126\\,\\text{m/s}$.",
