    prompt_text: "A $5\\,\\text{kg}$ block on a horizontal frictionless table is connected by a cord over a frictionless pulley at the table's edge to a $3\\,\\text{kg}$ block hanging vertically. Find the acceleration of the blocks and the tension in the cord. Use $g = 9.8\\,\\text{m/s}^2$.",
