    first_principle_target: "Conservation of Energy",
    solution_outline: "Energy conservation: $\\tfrac{1}{2}v^2 = GM/R - GM/(R+h)$ with $v=\\tfrac{1}{2}v_{esc}$ and $v_{esc}^2=2gR$. Solving gives max height $h = R/3$.",
