    first_principle_target: "Conservation of Energy",
    solution_outline: "Circular: $v_c = \\sqrt{GM/r}$; escape: $v_{esc} = \\sqrt{2GM/r} = \\sqrt{2}\\,v_c$. Speed must increase by factor $\\sqrt{2}$ (about $41\\%$).",
