    solution_outline: "Midpoint at $(7.5t,10t)$; ground distance from port $s=\\sqrt{7.5^2+10^2}\\,t=12.5t$. Drone distance $D=\\sqrt{(12.5t)^2+12^2}$. At $t=2$: $s=25$, $ds/dt=12.5$, $D=\\sqrt{625+144}=\\sqrt{769}$, $dD/dt=(s\\,ds/dt)/D=312.5/\\sqrt{769}\\approx11.27$ km/h.",
