    prompt_text: "An open-top box is made from a $30\\text{ cm} \\times 30\\text{ cm}$ square sheet of metal by cutting a square of side $x$ from each corner and folding up the sides. Find the value of $x$ that maximizes the volume of the box, and state that maximum volume.",
