    solution_outline: "$V(x)=x(30-2x)^2$; $V'(x)=(30-2x)(30-6x)=0$ gives $x=5$ cm. Max volume $=5\\cdot 20^2=2000\\text{ cm}^3$.",
    major_category: "all",
